Package: openmediavault-1panel
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0), curl, ca-certificates
Priority: optional
Description: openmediavault 1Panel plugin
 Manage the 1Panel Linux server management panel from the
 OpenMediaVault web interface: installs the official upstream
 binaries (downloaded from the 1Panel CDN, never recompiled),
 runs the official installer non-interactively with a random
 secure entrance and generated credentials, and offers start/
 stop/restart, online upgrade via the official '1pctl update',
 non-interactive uninstall (data is kept), live service status
 for the 1panel-core and 1panel-agent systemd units, log viewer
 and account synchronization through the official CLI.
 The panel itself (app store, websites, databases) is managed
 in the native 1Panel interface. Includes Chinese translations.
